WEBVTT

00:03.253 --> 00:06.089
Go, Eren!

00:14.180 --> 00:15.682
In the year 850,

00:16.725 --> 00:21.730
humanity successfully took back the land
that the Titans have taken away from them.

00:23.356 --> 00:25.483
At great cost.

00:28.153 --> 00:30.488
All of you here are hereby accepted

00:30.697 --> 00:33.199
as new members of the Scout Regiment!

00:33.742 --> 00:35.577
This is a genuine salute!

00:36.119 --> 00:37.787
Give your hearts!

00:39.539 --> 00:40.498
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:44.627 --> 00:46.671
You've done well to endure your fear.

00:47.380 --> 00:49.424
You're all brave soldiers.

00:50.341 --> 00:51.843
I respect you from the bottom of my heart.

00:53.678 --> 00:54.846
One month later,

00:55.889 --> 00:58.516
the Scout Regiment, led by Erwin Smith,

00:59.184 --> 01:03.021
left Calaneth District to establish
a route to Shiganshina District,

01:03.104 --> 01:06.483
which is believed to house
a secret about the Titans.

01:12.155 --> 01:15.283
Now commencing
the 57th Exterior Scouting Mission!

01:16.493 --> 01:18.203
Move out!

03:16.154 --> 03:18.323
A 10-meter Titan ahead,
approaching from the left!

03:18.823 --> 03:21.868
I'm extremely curious to know
what's inside its stomach!

03:22.243 --> 03:24.495
But I'll let the support team handle it!

03:28.166 --> 03:29.083
Damn it!

03:29.459 --> 03:30.335
Not deep enough!

03:31.210 --> 03:32.503
Defend the ranks!

03:37.217 --> 03:38.218
Don't falter!

03:38.635 --> 03:39.761
Leave it to the support team!

03:39.844 --> 03:40.845
Keep moving!

03:43.181 --> 03:44.515
Forward!

03:44.766 --> 03:47.185
Forward!

03:52.106 --> 03:54.859
The support team will only cover us
until we're through the old city.

03:55.193 --> 03:58.238
Everything beyond that
is entire Titan territory.

03:58.863 --> 04:00.240
From then on,

04:00.448 --> 04:04.160
we'll have to rely on Commander Erwin's
Long-Range Scouting Formation.

04:05.078 --> 04:07.538
Our Special Operations Squad
will be positioned here.

04:10.208 --> 04:15.171
Oruo, do you think my classmates can beat
the Titans in a fight?

04:15.588 --> 04:16.464
What?

04:16.547 --> 04:19.676
What the hell have you been doing
this last month?

04:21.052 --> 04:22.595
Listen, kid!

04:23.012 --> 04:27.600
Exterior Scouting Missions
are about fighting Titans as little as--

04:35.775 --> 04:38.236
Assume Long-Range Scouting Formation!

04:40.238 --> 04:41.572
See you later, Armin.

04:42.490 --> 04:45.285
Don't wet your pants
if you run into a Titan!

04:45.660 --> 04:47.578
Right! Same to you!

04:55.837 --> 04:57.922
This formation
is a forward-facing semicircle,

04:58.006 --> 05:00.842
with soldiers positioned far
from each other at equal intervals,

05:00.925 --> 05:02.760
yet still within clear sight on all sides.

05:03.469 --> 05:05.596
Extend the spotting and signaling range

05:05.930 --> 05:07.390
as far as possible!

05:07.473 --> 05:09.851
SECOND ROW, FOURTH
COMMUNICATION

05:33.249 --> 05:34.083
It's okay.

05:34.584 --> 05:35.501
Stay calm.

05:40.214 --> 05:44.635
The forward Scouts
will encounter most of the Titans.

05:46.304 --> 05:47.722
FIRST ROW, EIGHT
SCOUT

05:51.267 --> 05:53.728
As soon as they spot a Titan,

05:53.811 --> 05:55.688
they'll fire a red smoke signal.

05:58.816 --> 06:02.737
Soldiers who see this signal
will then signal others similarly.

06:04.405 --> 06:06.365
SECOND ROW, CENTER
COMMAND

06:06.949 --> 06:10.328
Once the Commander
has learned of the Titan's position,

06:10.453 --> 06:12.288
he'll fire a green signal

06:13.664 --> 06:16.626
and reroute the entire platoon around it.

06:18.920 --> 06:23.508
This will allow the platoon
to proceed toward its destination

06:23.591 --> 06:25.718
while avoiding the Titans entirely.

06:26.177 --> 06:28.137
SECOND ROW, THIRD
COMMUNICATION

06:28.596 --> 06:31.307
However, as the terrain
and other obstacles

06:31.390 --> 06:32.767
could delay their detection,

06:33.059 --> 06:36.020
we may encounter Titans
inside the formation.

06:43.694 --> 06:44.570
Red...

06:44.654 --> 06:46.030
Red signal!

06:50.034 --> 06:51.911
Braus! Over here!

06:54.080 --> 06:56.374
Damn! The spotters missed one!

06:56.582 --> 06:57.959
Let's lure it this way!

06:58.626 --> 07:00.461
Braus! Run toward us!

07:11.264 --> 07:12.223
Break away!

07:12.306 --> 07:13.766
- I'll handle this!
- Yes, sir!

07:32.535 --> 07:33.536
Sir!

07:33.953 --> 07:34.954
It's conked out!

07:35.288 --> 07:36.581
Return to your position!

07:42.044 --> 07:43.421
Something is not right.

07:44.005 --> 07:46.132
It's been a while
since the last red signal,

07:46.340 --> 07:47.800
yet the formation is in disarray.

07:48.593 --> 07:49.427
Could it be...

07:50.720 --> 07:55.475
Keep in mind that this strategy
will only work with normal Titans,

07:55.558 --> 07:57.059
the ones with predictable behavior.

08:00.229 --> 08:01.564
A black smoke signal?

08:02.356 --> 08:03.941
It's ignoring everyone nearby

08:04.108 --> 08:05.943
and heading straight
for the center of the formation?

08:07.320 --> 08:08.321
No doubt about it!

08:08.404 --> 08:09.363
It's...

08:10.990 --> 08:12.033
an Abnormal!

08:13.993 --> 08:18.247
Combat is necessary only when dealing
with unpredictable Abnormals!

08:18.623 --> 08:19.707
Damn it!

08:19.790 --> 08:21.000
We have no choice but to fight!

08:21.209 --> 08:23.127
Cis! You go for its nape!

08:23.461 --> 08:24.754
I'll stop it in its tracks!

08:25.004 --> 08:26.047
Understood!

08:28.257 --> 08:31.052
An ODM battle on level ground puts us
at a clear disadvantage.

08:31.427 --> 08:33.304
Our chances of success are incredibly low,

08:33.679 --> 08:36.265
but we can't afford
to let it wreck our formation!

08:37.558 --> 08:39.644
If I'm not wrong,
Arlelt should be over there.

08:40.102 --> 08:42.688
I can't let a rookie face this thing!

08:43.397 --> 08:44.565
I'm taking it out here!

08:53.074 --> 08:54.242
Now, Cis!

09:01.165 --> 09:03.334
Way to go, Squad Leader Ness!

09:06.128 --> 09:07.171
Got it!

09:09.215 --> 09:10.299
You came!

09:10.591 --> 09:12.218
You're my horse, all right!

09:13.386 --> 09:15.471
I love you, Charrete!

09:24.021 --> 09:24.981
Another one?

09:25.439 --> 09:27.650
What are the right-wing Scouts doing?

09:28.067 --> 09:29.902
It must be an Abnormal too.

09:29.986 --> 09:31.571
It's ignoring everyone on its way here.

09:32.530 --> 09:34.031
All right.

09:35.199 --> 09:36.951
Let's do it again, Cis!

09:37.034 --> 09:37.868
Yes, sir!

09:38.869 --> 09:42.081
Man, two in a row? Talk about unlucky.

09:42.873 --> 09:45.251
Plus, this one looks to be 14-meter high.

09:45.585 --> 09:47.253
This is going to be tough.

09:57.013 --> 09:57.972
What the...

09:58.222 --> 09:59.181
It's way too fast!

09:59.640 --> 10:01.350
Stop it from heading towards Arlelt!

10:01.434 --> 10:02.351
Cis!

10:02.643 --> 10:03.561
Yes, sir!

10:38.012 --> 10:40.014
No! This one's different!

10:40.765 --> 10:41.891
This isn't an Abnormal.

10:42.224 --> 10:43.643
It has intelligence!

10:43.976 --> 10:46.771
It's just like the Armored Titan,
the Colossal Titan, and Eren!

10:47.521 --> 10:49.774
It's a human clad in a Titan body!

10:50.483 --> 10:51.692
But who?

10:51.984 --> 10:53.194
Why?

10:53.361 --> 10:54.695
This is bad! What do I do?

10:54.779 --> 10:56.906
It's going to kill me too!

10:58.532 --> 10:59.408
Go!

10:59.575 --> 11:00.451
Run for it!

11:07.750 --> 11:08.959
What is its...

11:11.545 --> 11:13.756
No, what is their...

11:17.093 --> 11:18.803
goal?

11:23.432 --> 11:25.059
Someone, let the others know.

11:26.060 --> 11:30.022
The right-wing Scouts
are almost entirely wiped out.

11:30.856 --> 11:35.361
A female-looking Titan brought
a horde of Titans with her.

11:36.862 --> 11:39.365
Is there anyone...

12:37.715 --> 12:40.009
It didn't kill me?

12:40.551 --> 12:42.011
What just happened?

12:42.845 --> 12:44.930
It pinched my hood and...

12:45.264 --> 12:46.307
My face?

12:47.516 --> 12:49.602
It checked my face?

12:50.269 --> 12:51.187
Armin!

12:52.521 --> 12:53.397
Reiner!

12:54.273 --> 12:56.192
Hey, can you stand?

12:56.775 --> 13:01.197
There's no surviving outside the wall
without a horse, you know!

13:01.280 --> 13:02.239
Hurry!

13:02.323 --> 13:03.240
Yes!

13:05.743 --> 13:07.828
I saw the smoke signal
for an Abnormal Titan.

13:08.329 --> 13:10.247
Is it that one with the nice butt?

13:10.706 --> 13:11.916
It's not an Abnormal!

13:12.333 --> 13:14.502
It's a human clad in a Titan body.

13:14.752 --> 13:15.711
What?

13:17.129 --> 13:18.088
Hold on!

13:18.172 --> 13:19.757
We need to fire a smoke signal first!

13:20.132 --> 13:21.300
Hurry.

13:21.550 --> 13:24.637
We have to let them know
that there's an emergency.

13:25.971 --> 13:26.847
Wait.

13:27.389 --> 13:28.724
It looks like Jean fired for us.

13:32.353 --> 13:34.104
From the right wing?

13:34.271 --> 13:36.899
They have suffered too severe of an attack
to continue the operation?

13:37.399 --> 13:39.985
Apparently, part of the right wing
has been wiped out!

13:40.277 --> 13:42.112
A whole horde of Titans showed up!

13:42.196 --> 13:43.864
I don't know how it happened though!

13:44.406 --> 13:46.367
A bunch of them are fast too!

13:46.784 --> 13:48.577
We're holding them off for now,

13:48.661 --> 13:50.329
but no one is on spotting duty!

13:50.996 --> 13:52.414
This is a serious setback.

13:52.498 --> 13:54.208
If we're not careful,
we could all get wiped out!

13:54.917 --> 13:56.919
That's the direction she came from.

13:57.670 --> 13:58.546
Could it be?

13:59.004 --> 14:01.006
Did she lead the Titans here?

14:01.632 --> 14:02.633
"She"?

14:03.425 --> 14:05.427
What's a Titan doing there?

14:06.262 --> 14:07.263
Is it an Abnormal?

14:07.555 --> 14:09.473
No.

14:09.848 --> 14:13.018
It's a human clad in a Titan body.

14:13.352 --> 14:15.646
A human who can do the same thing as Eren.

14:16.021 --> 14:17.064
What?

14:17.523 --> 14:19.608
What makes you think that, Armin?

14:21.068 --> 14:23.487
Eating is all that Titans do.

14:24.071 --> 14:28.450
This results in death, of course.
Killing isn't their actual goal though.

14:28.993 --> 14:34.123
But as soon as more experienced soldiers
went for her vital spot,

14:34.206 --> 14:35.457
she crushed and swatted them down.

14:36.667 --> 14:40.004
And she didn't do it to eat them,
she did it to kill them.

14:40.504 --> 14:42.798
She's unlike any other Titan
in that regard.

14:43.549 --> 14:46.969
She must have been the one
who brought the hordes of Titans

14:47.344 --> 14:50.973
when the Colossal and Armored Titans
destroyed the walls.

14:51.640 --> 14:54.643
Meaning, she's had a consistent goal
of attacking mankind.

14:56.687 --> 14:58.272
Or actually,

14:58.939 --> 15:01.275
she might be searching for someone.

15:02.026 --> 15:04.695
If so, who?

15:05.738 --> 15:07.364
Could it be Eren?

15:07.865 --> 15:09.074
Eren?

15:09.575 --> 15:11.160
Eren is with the Squad Levi.

15:11.243 --> 15:13.996
They are in charge of the right wing.

15:14.872 --> 15:15.915
The right wing?

15:16.665 --> 15:20.586
My copy of the plan had them
in the rear of the left wing.

15:21.795 --> 15:26.467
My copy placed them
at the front of the right wing.

15:27.092 --> 15:30.012
Wait, there's no way they would be put
on the front lines like that.

15:30.471 --> 15:32.806
Then where are they?

15:33.349 --> 15:36.602
The safest place in this formation,
I would assume.

15:37.603 --> 15:38.437
Which would be

15:39.063 --> 15:41.148
the rear of the center rank.

15:42.024 --> 15:42.942
Armin!

15:43.442 --> 15:45.736
This is no time to get lost in thought!

15:46.070 --> 15:49.406
Smoke signals aren't enough to explain
how much of a threat she poses!

15:49.907 --> 15:52.117
At this rate,
she'll take out the command squad too.

15:52.201 --> 15:55.245
And if that happens,
the formation falls apart and we all die!

15:55.537 --> 15:56.747
What are you suggesting?

15:57.206 --> 16:01.543
I'm suggesting that from this distance,
we might still be able to distract her.

16:02.086 --> 16:05.214
We can buy some time
for everyone to retreat.

16:05.881 --> 16:09.009
Maybe, anyway.

16:11.303 --> 16:13.639
She really does have intelligence.

16:14.098 --> 16:17.434
From her point of view,
we're just like insects.

16:17.810 --> 16:19.770
All it takes is one swipe to kill us.

16:20.020 --> 16:21.271
You don't say.

16:22.690 --> 16:24.316
That's some scary stuff.

16:24.650 --> 16:27.486
Are you really Jean?

16:27.653 --> 16:31.782
The Jean I know
only ever cares about himself.

16:32.324 --> 16:34.118
That's rude.

16:36.453 --> 16:39.415
I simply do not want to disappoint

16:39.498 --> 16:43.502
those bone ashes
that we could not even identify.

16:44.211 --> 16:46.255
I...

16:46.922 --> 16:49.758
I know what needs to be done now!

16:50.092 --> 16:52.886
Plus, we chose to take this job!

16:53.137 --> 16:54.221
Help me!

17:00.060 --> 17:01.353
Put your hoods on!

17:01.437 --> 17:04.523
All the way, so she can't see your face!

17:04.898 --> 17:09.445
Because she can't risk killing us
if she can't tell who we are!

17:09.528 --> 17:10.779
I get it.

17:11.155 --> 17:14.366
She can't risk killing anyone
who might be Eren.

17:15.075 --> 17:16.785
Now that's a relief to know.

17:17.202 --> 17:20.247
Here's to hoping
that she has bad eyesight too!

17:21.040 --> 17:21.957
Armin.

17:22.291 --> 17:26.462
The way you always clung so close
to Eren used to creep me out,

17:26.879 --> 17:28.589
but I always knew I could count on you.

17:28.756 --> 17:29.715
What?

17:29.798 --> 17:31.133
Oh, thanks.

17:31.925 --> 17:34.470
But that's mean, thinking I'm creepy.

17:49.443 --> 17:51.695
She's a lot slower
than when she came from that way.

17:52.446 --> 17:53.447
Is she tired?

17:54.364 --> 17:56.658
If she takes off at that speed again,
we'll be too late!

17:57.284 --> 17:58.452
We have to do it now!

17:58.786 --> 18:00.079
We have to act now, or else...

18:06.251 --> 18:09.171
All right, guys.
Do it like we just discussed.

18:09.630 --> 18:11.840
Distract her for as long as possible,

18:12.132 --> 18:14.051
so the platoon can retreat!

18:14.551 --> 18:16.595
We have to keep her here
as long as we can!

18:17.721 --> 18:20.516
Cutting her heel tendons
should be more than enough.

18:21.100 --> 18:24.895
But don't do anything crazy.
We don't need to kill her!

18:25.521 --> 18:28.148
She's aware of the vital spot on her nape.

18:28.649 --> 18:30.859
She's completely different
from the other Titans.

18:31.026 --> 18:32.653
Killing her is probably
out of the question.

18:33.028 --> 18:37.074
At least for ordinary people, anyway.

18:40.911 --> 18:43.705
But maybe those two could.

19:25.664 --> 19:26.665
Armin!

19:28.876 --> 19:32.254
This one is way more athletic
than the other ones!

19:32.504 --> 19:34.423
Damn! We were...

19:34.756 --> 19:36.133
We were too naive!

19:41.889 --> 19:43.348
She's protecting her nape?

19:43.891 --> 19:44.766
Jean!

19:46.059 --> 19:48.270
Damn it! There's no escape now!

19:48.770 --> 19:49.771
I'm dead!

19:50.189 --> 19:51.690
She's going to grab my wire and finish me!

19:55.819 --> 19:56.820
Jean!

19:56.904 --> 19:59.448
Avenge that suicidal maniac!

20:01.283 --> 20:02.159
Armin?

20:03.410 --> 20:04.828
She stopped?

20:05.370 --> 20:07.956
It was her! She killed him!

20:08.123 --> 20:11.084
That maniac finally got himself killed
as part of the right wing!

20:11.168 --> 20:13.420
She killed him!

20:18.926 --> 20:20.260
What's going on?

20:21.428 --> 20:23.513
Did he hit his head and get confused?

20:23.597 --> 20:25.224
This is the worst possible time!

20:27.100 --> 20:28.018
Reiner?

20:29.061 --> 20:31.939
She crushed my friend!

20:32.189 --> 20:34.858
I saw him stuck to the bottom of her foot!

20:37.611 --> 20:39.446
He's going straight for the nape?

20:39.947 --> 20:41.323
No, he can do it!

20:41.490 --> 20:43.951
Now is his chance,
while she's focused on Armin!

20:51.959 --> 20:53.627
Hey.

21:06.515 --> 21:07.641
Hey!

21:08.267 --> 21:09.184
Reiner...

21:09.601 --> 21:10.560
You...

21:27.411 --> 21:29.246
Old Reiner actually did it!

21:29.788 --> 21:32.082
Mikasa stole so much of the spotlight
that I forgot

21:32.165 --> 21:35.335
that he's extremely skilled
and dependable too!

21:36.128 --> 21:38.380
I'd say we bought enough time!

21:38.463 --> 21:40.173
Now let's get away from her, quick!

21:40.465 --> 21:44.177
She doesn't eat people!
I don't think she'll follow us!

21:52.561 --> 21:53.687
Look!

21:53.770 --> 21:57.691
The giant wench is running home
with her tail between her legs!

21:57.983 --> 21:58.859
What?

21:59.234 --> 22:00.110
Oh, no.

22:00.193 --> 22:01.069
Why?

22:01.403 --> 22:03.739
The rear of the center rank is that way.

22:04.281 --> 22:07.200
Is she heading for Eren?

23:43.421 --> 23:44.673
"You monster!"

23:45.632 --> 23:50.220
Not even the highly-trained Scout Regiment
can stop the Female Titan.

23:51.179 --> 23:53.765
Eventually,
inside a forest of giant trees,

23:53.849 --> 23:56.017
the monster finally catches sight of Eren.
